WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.958
Today is the third move. The picture comes last.

2
00:00:03.408 --> 00:00:05.987
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.487 --> 00:00:10.732
On today's page, some pictures match their word. And some are a trick.

4
00:00:11.182 --> 00:00:14.744
Tell your child so. Today it is a game. Match, or trick?

5
00:00:15.194 --> 00:00:19.553
Cover the picture with your hand. Then your child reads the word, every letter.

6
00:00:23.048 --> 00:00:24.063
The word is fin.

7
00:00:24.963 --> 00:00:29.119
Now uncover the picture. It shows a fan. So this one is a trick.

8
00:00:29.919 --> 00:00:33.043
The letters tell you the word. The picture can only check it.

9
00:00:33.493 --> 00:00:35.443
Do the two words of job one together.

10
00:00:35.893 --> 00:00:42.078
For job two, your child lays the slide card over the row of pictures, and reads the words above it.

11
00:00:42.528 --> 00:00:48.588
Press play on the sound track and step away. The voice says each word, so your child can check it alone.

12
00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.613
Then your child lifts the card, and crosses out each trick picture. There are three.

13
00:00:54.063 --> 00:00:58.511
In other books this week, do the same. Cover the picture until the words are read.

14
00:00:58.961 --> 00:01:01.473
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
